#: title/pc5_ui.c:6266
msgid ""
"PC5's choice: VKD3D-Proton turns the game's Direct3D 12 into Vulkan. The "
"fastest, and what most games want."
msgstr ""
"Keuze van PC5: VKD3D-Proton zet de Direct3D 12 van de game om naar Vulkan. "
"Het snelst, en wat de meeste games willen."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6267
msgid ""
"PC5's choice: Wine's own Direct3D draws the game's DirectDraw with OpenGL."
msgstr ""
"Keuze van PC5: de eigen Direct3D van Wine tekent de DirectDraw van de game "
"met OpenGL."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6268
msgid ""
"PC5's choice: DXVK turns the game's Direct3D into Vulkan. The fastest, and "
"what most games want."
msgstr ""
"Keuze van PC5: DXVK zet de Direct3D van de game om naar Vulkan. Het "
"snelst, en wat de meeste games willen."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6270
msgid ""
"Wine's own Direct3D 12 (VKD3D). Slower than Auto; try it if the game won't "
"start or draws wrong."
msgstr ""
"De eigen Direct3D 12 van Wine (VKD3D). Trager dan Auto; probeer het als de "
"game niet start of verkeerd tekent."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6272
msgid ""
"Wine's own Direct3D, drawing with Vulkan. Try it if the game draws wrong "
"with Auto; often faster than WineD3D."
msgstr ""
"De eigen Direct3D van Wine, tekent met Vulkan. Probeer het als de game met "
"Auto verkeerd tekent; vaak sneller dan WineD3D."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6273
msgid ""
"Wine's own Direct3D, drawing with OpenGL. The slowest; try it if the game "
"won't start with the others."
msgstr ""
"De eigen Direct3D van Wine, tekent met OpenGL. Het traagst; probeer het "
"als de game met de andere niet start."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6294
#, c-format
msgid "The game uses %s"
msgstr "De game gebruikt %s"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6306
msgid "In use"
msgstr "In gebruik"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6326
msgid ""
"PC5 runs your PC games with prospero-win: Wine, DXVK for Direct3D 8 to 11, "
"VKD3D-Proton for Direct3D 12, and Mesa (RADV for Vulkan, Zink for OpenGL)."
msgstr ""
"PC5 draait je pc-games met prospero-win: Wine, DXVK voor Direct3D 8 tot "
"11, VKD3D-Proton voor Direct3D 12 en Mesa (RADV voor Vulkan, Zink voor "
"OpenGL)."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6328
msgid ""
"Covers come from Steam, GOG, PCGamingWiki and Wikidata, and SteamGridDB "
