#: title/pc5_web_page.html:239
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Not shown: %s"
msgstr "Niet getoond: %s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:253
msgctxt "web"
msgid "UTF-8 with its mark"
msgstr "UTF-8 met BOM"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:254
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Western (one byte a letter)"
msgstr "West-Europees (één byte per letter)"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:255
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"%s · %s line ends · %d lines · %s. Saved as it was: the same encoding and "
"line ends. A game reads it at its next start."
msgstr ""
"%s · %s-regeleinden · %d regels · %s. Opgeslagen zoals het was: dezelfde "
"codering en regeleinden. Een game leest het bij de volgende start."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:257
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Sluiten"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:265
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Saved."
msgstr "Opgeslagen."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:273
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Close without saving the changes?"
msgstr "Sluiten zonder de wijzigingen op te slaan?"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:278
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Wine writes its .reg files while a game plays: change them only when no "
"game is running."
msgstr ""
"Wine schrijft zijn .reg-bestanden terwijl een game draait: wijzig ze "
"alleen als er geen game draait."

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:280
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Not opened: %s"
msgstr "Niet geopend: %s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:283
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Text files only (.ini, .cfg, .txt, .json, .reg and the like), up to 8 MB. "
"The console's File manager changes them too, a line at a time."
msgstr ""
"Alleen tekstbestanden (.ini, .cfg, .txt, .json, .reg en dergelijke), tot 8 "
"MB. Bestandsbeheer op de console wijzigt ze ook, regel voor regel."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:294
msgctxt "web"
msgid "No games yet."
msgstr "Nog geen games."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:297
msgctxt "web"
msgid "USB drive"
msgstr "USB-schijf"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:298
msgctxt "web"
msgid "can't start"
msgstr "kan niet starten"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:303
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Settings: %s"
msgstr "Instellingen: %s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:306
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Newest log"
msgstr "Nieuwste log"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:308
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Report a problem"
msgstr "Probleem melden"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:309
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Downloads the newest log and opens GitHub's form, filled in: attach the "
"log there."
msgstr ""
"Downloadt het nieuwste log en opent het ingevulde formulier van GitHub: "
"voeg het log daar toe."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:315
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Launch options (launch.txt)"
msgstr "Startopties (launch.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:316
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"The first line that isn't empty or a comment (# or ;) is added to the "
"program's command line."
msgstr ""
"De eerste regel die niet leeg is en geen opmerking (# of ;), wordt "
"toegevoegd aan de opdrachtregel van het programma."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:320
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Environment variables (env.txt)"
msgstr "Omgevingsvariabelen (env.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:320
msgctxt "web"
msgid "One NAME=value a line, set before the game starts."
msgstr "Eén NAAM=waarde per regel, ingesteld voordat de game start."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:321
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Extra logging (winedebug.txt)"
msgstr "Extra logging (winedebug.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:322
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Only when an issue asks for it, for example err+all,+seh. Empty it "
"afterwards: it slows the game down."
msgstr ""
"Alleen als een issue erom vraagt, bijvoorbeeld err+all,+seh. Maak het "
"daarna weer leeg: het maakt de game trager."

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:327
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "The games didn't load: %s"
msgstr "De games zijn niet geladen: %s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:340
msgctxt "web"
msgid "No logs kept."
msgstr "Geen logs bewaard."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:344
